  "title": "Bacon-Wrapped Chicken in the Oven",
  "description": "Bacon insulates spicy-sweet chicken breast, adding smoky-salty notes and a crispy crunch. It pairs well with corn, roasted vegetables, or fresh bread.",
  "authors": [
    "Zachary Hensler"
  ],
